### 4. Configuration (`FlowConfig`)

Ensure your `ChatModel` supports JSON-capable models:

```java
@Bean
public ChatClient chatClient(OpenAiChatModel chatModel) {
    return ChatClient.builder(chatModel).build();
}

@Bean
public OpenAiChatModel chatModel() {
    OpenAIClient openAIClient = buildOpenAIClient();
    OpenAiApi openAiApi = new OpenAiApi(openAIClient);
    return new OpenAiChatModel(openAiApi, OpenAiChatOptions.builder()
        .withModel("gpt-4o") // Use a model that supports JSON mode
        .build());
}
```

- **Model**: Use `gpt-4o` or `gpt-3.5-turbo-1106` (JSON mode supported).

