### Alternative: Raw JSON Output

If you want the flow to return the raw JSON string instead of formatting it:

```java
@Override
public String execute(String userInput, String sessionId, DynamicPromptService promptService, LlmService llmService) {
    String promptInstruction = userInput + "\nReturn your response as a JSON object with 'problem', 'severity', and 'suggestion' fields.";
    String dynamicPrompt = promptService.buildPrompt(promptInstruction, null, getTemplateName(), 
                                                   getVectorStore(), getKnowledgeStore(), sessionId);
    String finalPrompt = getPromptText() + "\n" + dynamicPrompt;

    ChatClient chatClient = ChatClient.builder(llmService.getChatModel()).build();
    String jsonResponse = chatClient.prompt()
        .user(finalPrompt)
        .call()
        .content(); // Get raw JSON string

    return jsonResponse; // Return raw JSON
}
```

#### Output
```
{"problem": "Unknown issue", "severity": "Medium", "suggestion": "Check logs for more details"}
```

